    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers",
     "texto": [
      "You already know 一, 二 and 三. Add **零** (zero) and **四** to **十** (ten). To form tens, combine the digit with 十: **二十** (twenty), **三十** (thirty), **四十** (forty).",
      "In English we ask «How old are you?»; in Chinese, 岁 («years old») goes after the number. You don't need a verb equivalent to «have» or «be», so there is nothing to conjugate."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
